data:{"type":"response.output_item.added","output_index":4,"item":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"**Average sentiment scores are nearly identical across all plan tiers**, ranging from 0.035 to 0.059 on a -1 to +1 scale. \\[[1](https://fevm-stable-classic-7ppxjq.cloud.databricks.com/genie/rooms/01f11dcb53181defb69ee49bd73bca10/chats/01f190fca898180a886b1bcd6244e0ed?o=7474660648944264&gra_focus=01f190fcabe61247a28131f8c6b84bf5)\\]\n\nDesignPro Free leads slightly at **0.059**, followed by Enterprise at **0.054** and Pro at **0.035**. All three products show marginally positive sentiment, with no meaningful difference between tiers.","annotations":[]}],"id":"01f190fcaf751a6281504352b8bfd024","status":"completed"},"sequence_number":9}

